Pantheon NTE-of-NTEs Controller v1.0

I took the existing NTE ensemble and extended it into a working adaptive controller.

It coordinates four Wild Hawg trajectories—audience, brand, product, and operations—while tracking how disturbances propagate between them.

The system now has three distinct responses:

* Resilence: Temporarily dampen the spread of an uncertain disturbance without hiding the original signal.
* Resilience: Direct limited corrective resources toward whichever trajectory needs them most.
* ZPC: Extract a candidate lesson from the disruption, preserve its history, and specify what evidence would validate it.

